\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath: A Curated Collection of Open Mathematics Problems, record 1436 (GRAPH-049). CC BY 4.0. \url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Khyodeno Mozhui, Tithi Dwary and K. V. Krishna, Line Graphs of Non-Word-Representable Graphs Are Not Always Non-Word-Representable, arXiv:2509.03339v1 (2025), Sections 1 and 3, Theorem 3.1. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/2509.03339v1}.
